 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I was wandering in the valley, lost and low",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying a burden that I couldn't let go",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I heard a promise from an old worn page",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Words that broke the chains and opened up the cage",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For God so loved the world",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That He gave His only begotten Son",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That whosoever believeth in Him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Should not perish, but have everlasting life",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Mama sang it softly when the night was long",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandpa hummed it working, made the weary strong",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a single soul is standing out of reach",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
